t. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002400/extras/97dd725330485424f72f55e144c8bd6c.poster.avif?t=1758825306\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002400/extras/97dd725330485424f72f55e144c8bd6c.webm?t=1758825306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002400/extras/97dd725330485424f72f55e144c8bd6c.mp4?t=1758825306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002400/extras/202610800b49c39d0c3492243a1cfa96.avif?t=1758825306\" width=616 height=26 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Black Annis features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the local legend of Black Annis.\u00a0 A creature that has haunted the Dane hills area of Leicester for hundreds of years.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Tense, atmospheric exploration in a realistic environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person puzzle interaction\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosaves</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short experience designed to be completed in under 2 hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Man the Barricades Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002400/15850886fac9148abc9fa4a